msgstr "Formularios"

#: includes/admin/class-leads-settings.php:230
msgid "No supported form plugin was found. Install Contact Form 7, WPForms or Gravity Forms and create a form."
msgstr "No se encontró ningún plugin de formularios compatible. Instala Contact Form 7, WPForms o Gravity Forms y crea un formulario."

